---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import AnimateOnScroll from '../components/AnimateOnScroll.astro';
---

<Layout title="Our Restoration Studio" description="Meet the Budapest-based CE Reinessance studio and our approach to heritage-led renovation across Central Europe.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="The studio" title="Built on respect for what endures." intro="We are a Budapest-based collective of architects, craftspeople and project leaders united by one belief: the best renovations make a historic building feel more itself—not less." index="01" />

  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="shell split-media">
      <AnimateOnScroll><img src="/assets/images/about.png" alt="CE Reinessance team in front of a restored brick residence" loading="eager" /></AnimateOnScroll>
      <AnimateOnScroll delay={120} class="split-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">A regional point of view</p>
        <h2>Local knowledge. International standards.</h2>
        <p>Central Europe’s architectural fabric is remarkably varied—and deeply regulated. Our network brings together local permitting knowledge, traditional craft and contemporary technical expertise in every city where we work.</p>
        <p>Clients deal with one accountable studio throughout. Behind that single relationship is a carefully assembled team specific to the property, its era and the ambition for its future.</p>
        <div class="stat-row"><div class="stat"><strong>4</strong><span>Capital cities</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>1</strong><span>Lead team</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>360°</strong><span>Project oversight</span></div></div>
      </AnimateOnScroll>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell">
    <AnimateOnScroll><div class="section-heading"><p class="section-kicker">How we work</p><h2>The details are<br />the design.</h2><p>Our decisions are guided by three principles that hold from the earliest survey through to the last piece of fitted joinery.</p></div></AnimateOnScroll>
    <div class="value-grid">
      <article class="value-card"><span>01</span><h3>Listen before drawing</h3><p>The building, its archives and its current owners all have something essential to tell us. Discovery shapes every proposal.</p></article>
      <article class="value-card"><span>02</span><h3>Intervene with purpose</h3><p>Every new material and system must earn its place. We favour clarity, durability and a quiet dialogue with the original fabric.</p></article>
      <article class="value-card"><span>03</span><h3>Make quality visible</h3><p>Good project leadership is felt in the finish: aligned teams, transparent decisions and craft delivered without compromise.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell quote-section">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Our responsibility</p><p>Past · Present · Future</p></div>
    <blockquote>“Restoration is not nostalgia. It is the disciplined act of carrying value forward.”<p class="quote-byline">CE Reinessance studio principle</p></blockquote>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">Work with us</p><h2>Bring us a building with a story worth continuing.</h2></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button button-light" href="/contact">Meet the studio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link light" href="/references">View our work</a></div></section>
</Layout>
